{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09337","headline":"与幼遐君贶兄弟同游白家竹潭 · 韦应物","name":"与幼遐君贶兄弟同游白家竹潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清赏非素期，偶游方自得。\n前登绝岭险，下视深潭黑。\n密竹已成暮，归云殊未极。\n春鸟依谷暄，紫兰含幽色。\n已将芳景遇，复款平生忆。\n终念一欢别，临风还默默。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09337.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09337","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}